{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/ab13944e4e333b26d8a1636bb588ee1f.avif?t=1768213020\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras_big/ab13944e4e333b26d8a1636bb588ee1f.avif?t=1768213020 width=800 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Horse Racing</strong> is a fast-paced arcade horse racing game where timing is everything! Master control patterns from easy to godlike difficulty, leap over big jumps, and race through vibrant tracks around the world. Climb the leagues, manage your horse, and gallop from bronze to gold!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc0e Big Jumps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/314201f66f5c4c5d43eca0200f905259.poster.avif?t=1768213020\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/314201f66f5c4c5d43eca0200f905259.webm?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/314201f66f5c4c5d43eca0200f905259.mp4?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar over huge jumps, collect coins mid-air, and leave your rivals in the dust!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Race The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/274a8728be3d1fd7893a4d1e482b14ca.poster.avif?t=1768213020\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/274a8728be3d1fd7893a4d1e482b14ca.webm?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/274a8728be3d1fd7893a4d1e482b14ca.mp4?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the Wild Horse Racing World Championship! Join League Races to earn points and climb the ranks \u2014 or enter Coin Races if you\u2019re low on cash or just need some practice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddfc Hoof &amp; Shoe Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/27b9d84848e73925b79eb67e58d5f899.poster.avif?t=1768213020\" width=480 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/27b9d84848e73925b79eb67e58d5f899.webm?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/27b9d84848e73925b79eb67e58d5f899.mp4?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mud and gravel build up during races and slow you down \u2014 keep your hooves clean! Upgrade your shoes: Each type comes with unique stats, durability, and powerful set bonuses to give you the edge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Unique Control Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every track has its own easy-to-learn control pattern. Nail the timing to gain speed \u2014 with support for both keyboard and gamepad patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/e75bbe242bf2b66ae5d0f6a3224cb370.poster.avif?t=1768213020\" width=670 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/e75bbe242bf2b66ae5d0f6a3224cb370.webm?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/e75bbe242bf2b66ae5d0f6a3224cb370.mp4?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/98c09bee8bd28cb9d10b7c99c11a72b1.poster.avif?t=1768213020\" width=670 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/98c09bee8bd28cb9d10b7c99c11a72b1.webm?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/98c09bee8bd28cb9d10b7c99c11a72b1.mp4?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc1 Cross the Finish Line</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/5ee7ea614959951093f1706c5e5ca822.poster.avif?t=1768213020\" width=800 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/5ee7ea614959951093f1706c5e5ca822.webm?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579620/extras/5ee7ea614959951093f1706c5e5ca822.mp4?t=1768213020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skills matter! Earn bonuses for accuracy, timing, and avoiding obstacles. Every race is a chance to prove yourself. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2579620?t=1768213020","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/257962